{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the O.D.D., a world where forgotten video game characters reside. <br> <br>Kidbash: Super Legend is a roguelike action-platformer that blends nostalgic gameplay with a character-rich story. You\u2019ll play as Kidbash, a hero stricken with amnesia, rediscovering your true identity and purpose while navigating vibrant landscapes of the O.D.D. and conquering challenging levels.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as a Lost Forgotten Hero</h2>Our hero, Kidbash, awakens with no memory of his past, only his name and a burning desire to become a hero. After failing to save the nearby village of Mandala, he seeks training from the legendary master of the mountain, Tao Shen Long, only to discover that he has disappeared. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/fd029d093a348fe5d1f9a4ffde4bce79.poster.avif?t=1771152077\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/fd029d093a348fe5d1f9a4ffde4bce79.webm?t=1771152077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/fd029d093a348fe5d1f9a4ffde4bce79.mp4?t=1771152077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapon Mixing</h2>Fill the meter up as you slay enemies, and you\u2019ll be able to combine 2 weapons to create more powerful one, each with unique mechanics\u2014totally not inspired by cough* Kirby 64 cough* <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/fb69d7e7ce524eb0fa8385c08e4cfc69.poster.avif?t=1771152077\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/fb69d7e7ce524eb0fa8385c08e4cfc69.webm?t=1771152077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/fb69d7e7ce524eb0fa8385c08e4cfc69.mp4?t=1771152077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Powerful Mod and Weapon Combinations</h2>Pick from randomized pool of mods that will enhance your platforming and combat. These mods even stack when you mix together your weapons!  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/30a691ae07a11e31f4a1ce998518f7f5.poster.avif?t=1771152077\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/30a691ae07a11e31f4a1ce998518f7f5.webm?t=1771152077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/30a691ae07a11e31f4a1ce998518f7f5.mp4?t=1771152077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Village Building &amp; Meta Progression</h2>You can help a cast of forgotten characters rebuild their destroyed village. Your meta progression and character development is very much tied to the village! <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/dd851189fdfb2df75187a9a608c4f9a4.poster.avif?t=1771152077\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/dd851189fdfb2df75187a9a608c4f9a4.webm?t=1771152077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/dd851189fdfb2df75187a9a608c4f9a4.mp4?t=1771152077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Foe to Friend?</h2>Find and battle bosses throughout the mountain. Each with unique abilities &amp; personalities, who knows, you might even become friends with some of them! (If you want) <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/dbd923878c9c81ee83547f9e5139ece3.poster.avif?t=1771152077\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/dbd923878c9c81ee83547f9e5139ece3.webm?t=1771152077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/dbd923878c9c81ee83547f9e5139ece3.mp4?t=1771152077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2681870?t=1771152077","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771152077","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/b616ed48302b29c92446c1c2bf11c22dd26cc15c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771152077","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/b616ed48302b29c92446c1c2bf11c22dd26cc15c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771152077","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the O.D.D., a world where forgotten video game characters reside. <br> <br>Kidbash: Super Legend is a roguelike action-platformer that blends nostalgic gameplay with a character-rich story. You\u2019ll play as Kidbash, a hero stricken with amnesia, rediscovering your true identity and purpose while navigating vibrant landscapes of the O.D.D. and conquering challenging levels.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as a Lost Forgotten Hero</h2>Our hero, Kidbash, awakens with no memory of his past, only his name and a burning desire to become a hero. After failing to save the nearby village of Mandala, he seeks training from the legendary master of the mountain, Tao Shen Long, only to discover that he has disappeared. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/fd029d093a348fe5d1f9a4ffde4bce79.poster.avif?t=1771152077\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/fd029d093a348fe5d1f9a4ffde4bce79.webm?t=1771152077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/fd029d093a348fe5d1f9a4ffde4bce79.mp4?t=1771152077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapon Mixing</h2>Fill the meter up as you slay enemies, and you\u2019ll be able to combine 2 weapons to create more powerful one, each with unique mechanics\u2014totally not inspired by cough* Kirby 64 cough* <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/fb69d7e7ce524eb0fa8385c08e4cfc69.poster.avif?t=1771152077\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/fb69d7e7ce524eb0fa8385c08e4cfc69.webm?t=1771152077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/fb69d7e7ce524eb0fa8385c08e4cfc69.mp4?t=1771152077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Powerful Mod and Weapon Combinations</h2>Pick from randomized pool of mods that will enhance your platforming and combat. These mods even stack when you mix together your weapons!  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/30a691ae07a11e31f4a1ce998518f7f5.poster.avif?t=1771152077\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/30a691ae07a11e31f4a1ce998518f7f5.webm?t=1771152077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/30a691ae07a11e31f4a1ce998518f7f5.mp4?t=1771152077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Village Building &amp; Meta Progression</h2>You can help a cast of forgotten characters rebuild their destroyed village. Your meta progression and character development is very much tied to the village! <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/dd851189fdfb2df75187a9a608c4f9a4.poster.avif?t=1771152077\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/dd851189fdfb2df75187a9a608c4f9a4.webm?t=1771152077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/dd851189fdfb2df75187a9a608c4f9a4.mp4?t=1771152077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Foe to Friend?</h2>Find and battle bosses throughout the mountain. Each with unique abilities &amp; personalities, who knows, you might even become friends with some of them! (If you want) <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/dbd923878c9c81ee83547f9e5139ece3.poster.avif?t=1771152077\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/dbd923878c9c81ee83547f9e5139ece3.webm?t=1771152077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/extras/dbd923878c9c81ee83547f9e5139ece3.mp4?t=1771152077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></strong></p>","developers":["Authentic Remixes","Fat Raccoon"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681870/header.jpg?t=1771152077","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2681870/877252294/28bff76511fd7819d8c7c2e098dc47c41c8f4123/1750942686/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748349399","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2681870/877252294/28bff76511fd7819d8c7c2e098dc47c41c8f4123/1750942686/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748349399","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2681870/877252294/28bff76511fd7819d8c7c2e098dc47c41c8f4123/1750942686/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748349399","id":257146356,"name":"KIDBASH: SUPER LEGEND TRAILER 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257146356/23dd891af439dfd70754fd3c706ab5d48287a5c2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748349399"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2681870/736446/310b04cc4019912a4acc715c0d0b76145e7b12e7/1750942685/dash_av1.mpd?t=1723054689","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2681870/736446/310b04cc4019912a4acc715c0d0b76145e7b12e7/1750942685/dash_h264.mpd?t=1723054689","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2681870/736446/310b04cc4019912a4acc715c0d0b76145e7b12e7/1750942685/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1723054689","id":257043